[36m@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@[m
[32m+[m[32mThe status bar shows TF-specific info, and it works in different ways depending on the client:[m
[32m+[m[32mFor fte, it will detect that csqc is active and send messages directly to the csqc part of the client to display individual HUD icons and statuses.[m
[32m+[m[32mFor ezquake (and basically everything else), it will use a centerprint hack to permanently display the status bar.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt can be enabled using the client setting[m
[32m+[m[32m    setinfo sb 40[m
[32m+[m[32m(or any positive integer). The integer is relevant for the non-fte version, as it dictates how many empty "lines" to skip before drawing it, thus allowing basic control of its veritcal position.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA specific sub-component can be enabled using the command[m
[32m+[m[32m    setinfo sbflaginfo 1|2[m
[32m+[m[32mSetting it to 0 will turn it off, setting it to 1 will enable it, but only 6 seconds after spawn (after the class tips finish displaying) and a setting of 2 will make it permanent.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe sb flaginfo will display the current status of any flags/item_tfgoals that have been tagged by the mapper. The logic is the same as the stock "flaginfo" command, which is marking up to 4 goalitems in the info_tfdetect[m
[32m+[m[32mentity using the fields display_item_status1 - display_item_status4 using the items' goal_no numbers. This is further documented in the tf reference docs.[m
[32m+[m[32mThis does limit the number of trackable items to 4 however.[m
[32m+[m[32mThe flaginfo functionality is extended by having it also display who it's currenly carried by, or, if dropped, the location (based on the loc file) and time to return.[m
[32m+[m[32mNote that currently, the item names are hard-coded to be "blue/red/yellow/green flag", to cover most cases, where mappers didn't necessarily name them nicely.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe sb flaginfo component also displays the "button" countdowns (such as lasers/security being down), if available, and there is room.[m
[32m+[m[32mThis functions in a similar way to the flag info, but, while technically unlimited,[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32mthe combined number of all sbar items (flags and buttons) is 10 for fte and 6 for ezquake.[m
