[32m+[m[32m----------------------------------------------------------------------------[m
[32m+[m[32mThe New TeamFortress Entity Reference Sheet                  TF Version 2.6[m
[32m+[m[32m----------------------------------------------------------------------------[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis is a reference sheet for people who're trying to read/debug the[m
[32m+[m[32mentities on their TF map. It's simply a quick description of every variable[m
[32m+[m[32mfor all the TF entities. It's simply a quick-reference. For full details,[m
[32m+[m[32msee the tfortmap.txt file.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPrint this out, and keep it by you whenever you're reading through someone[m
[32m+[m[32melse's .map file to see how they did something :)  Also get Raistlan's EntEd[m
[32m+[m[32mwhich supports TeamFortress Entities at http://www.lockandload.com/ented/[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRobin (walker@netspace.net.au) | Network (network@lockandload.com)[m
[32m+[m[32m----------------------------------------------------------------------------[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mGLOSSARY[m
[32m+[m[32m--------[m
[32m+[m[32mAP  :  Activating Player. The player who activated a Goal/Trigger, or picked[m
[32m+[m[32m       up the GoalItem.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAPA :  Any Player Affected. Any player who is affected by the current[m
[32m+[m[32m       Goal/Trigger/Item's activation.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mINDEX[m
[32m+[m[32m--------[m
[32m+[m[32m  I. :  DETECTION ENTITY VARIABLES (info_tfdetect)[m
[32m+[m[32m II. :  TEAM SPAWNPOINT VARIABLES (info_player_teamspawn)[m
[32m+[m[32mIII. :  GOAL VARIABLES (info_tfgoal)[m
[32m+[m[32m IV. :  GOALITEM VARIABLES (item_tfgoal)[m
[32m+[m[32m  V. :  TIMER GOAL VARIABLES (info_tfgoal_timer)[m
[32m+[m[32m VI. :  OTHER QUAKE ENTITY VARIABLES[m
[32m+[m[32mVII. :  VARIABLE ABBREVIATION LIST[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m============================================================================[m
[32m+[m[32mDETECTION ENTITY VARIABLES (info_tfdetect)[m
[32m+[m[32m============================================================================[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mbroadcast               The TF version string. e.g. "TeamFortress v2.6"[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mimpulse                 Initial Toggleflags status. Bitfields: (Unspecified = OFF)[m
[32m+[m[32m                                  1 : ClasSkin          Off/On[m[41m   [m
[32m+[m[32m                                  2 : ClassPersistence  Off/On[m
[32m+[m[32m                                  4 : CheatChecking     Off/On[m
[32m+[m[32m                                  8 : FortressMap       Off/On[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 16 : RespawnDelay  See tfortmap.txt[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 32 : RespawnDelay  See tfortmap.txt[m
[32m+[m[32m                                 64 : AutoTeam          Off/On[m
[32m+[m[32m                                128 : Individual Frags  Off/On[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mmessage                 Commands that are localcmd'd into the server when the map[m
[32m+[m[32m                        first starts. e.g.  "sv_gravity 300\nsv_friction 0.1\n"[m
[32m+[m[32m                        Be sure to end all commands with '\n'.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mammo_shells             Max number of lives for each player in Team 1.[m
[32m+[m[32mammo_nails              Max number of lives for each player in Team 2.[m
[32m+[m[32mammo_rockets            Max number of lives for each player in Team 3.[m
[32m+[m[32mammo_cells              Max number of lives for each player in Team 4.[m
[32m+[m[32m                                (0 = Unlimited number of lives)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mammo_medikit            Maximum number of players allowed in Team 1.[m
[32m+[m[32mammo_detpack            Maximum number of players allowed in Team 2.[m
[32m+[m[32mmaxammo_medikit         Maximum number of players allowed in Team 3.[m
[32m+[m[32mmaxammo_detpack         Maximum number of players allowed in Team 4.[m
[32m+[m[32m                                (0 = Unlimited number of players)[m
[32m+[m
