[32m+[m		[32m"display_item_status2"	: Item 2[m
[32m+[m		[32m"display_item_status3"	: Item 2[m
[32m+[m		[32m"display_item_status4"	: Item 2[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m	[32m  The strings are specified in the following variables:[m
[32m+[m	[32m    "team_str_home"		: Displayed when the item is at the point[m
[32m+[m							[32m  it originally spawned at.[m[41m [m
[32m+[m	[32m    "team_str_moved"	: Displayed if the item has been moved from[m
[32m+[m		[41m [m					[32m  it's original spawning point.[m
[32m+[m	[32m    "team_str_carried"	: Displayed if the item is being carried. It[m
[32m+[m							[32m  is prepended to the carrier's name, or " You"[m
[32m+[m							[32m  if the Player is carrying the item.[m
[32m+[m							[32m  e.g. "Your flag is being carried by" Bro.[m
[32m+[m	[32m    "non_team_str_home"		: Displayed when the item is at the point[m
[32m+[m							[41m  [m	[32mit originally spawned at.[m[41m [m
[32m+[m	[32m    "non_team_str_moved"	: Displayed if the item has been moved from[m
[32m+[m		[41m [m					[41m  [m	[32m  it's original spawning point.[m
[32m+[m	[32m    "non_team_str_carried"	: Displayed if the item is being carried. It[m
[32m+[m							[41m  [m	[32m  is prepended to the carrier's name, or " You"[m
[32m+[m								[32m  if the Player is carrying the item.[m
[32m+[m								[32m  e.g. "The enemy flag is being carried by" You.[m
[32m+[m[41m	[m
