[32m+[m[32m      die... just respawns.[m
[32m+[m[32m      Used in conjunction with TeamSpawns that have criteria and the[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m      enable/disable TeamSpawns capabilities, this can be used to[m
[32m+[m[32m      move an entire team to specific points around the map.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    - An new bit (2048) was added to "goal_activation" for Goals and GoalItems.[m
[32m+[m[32m        2048: If this bit is set, the Goal/Item drops to the ground when it[m
[32m+[m[32m              first spawns.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    - Another new bit (4096) was added to "goal_activation" for GoalItems.[m
[32m+[m[32m        4096: If this bit is set, any player carrying this item can drop[m
[32m+[m[32m              it using the "dropitems" command.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    - Yet another bit (8192) was added to "goal_activation" for GoalItems.[m
[32m+[m[32m        8192: If this bit is set, the GoalItem is Solid while not[m
[32m+[m[32m              being carried by a player. This means it blocks bullets,[m
[32m+[m[32m              grenades.[m
[32m+[m[32m              N.B. It will also block any players that don't pass it's[m
[32m+[m[32m                   criteria. Players that do pass the criteria will[m
[32m+[m[32m                   simply pick it up.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    - The size of a Goal or GoalItem can now be set using the "goal_min"[m
[32m+[m[32m      and "goal_max" variables to set the min and max bounding box.[m
[32m+[m[32m      If not set, they default to:[m
[32m+[m		[32m"goal_min"       "-16 -16 -24"[m
[32m+[m		[32m"goal_max"       "16 16 32"[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    - More Abbreviations, as follows:[m
[32m+[m[41m    [m	[32mFloats[m
[32m+[m[32m            "h_i_g"	    for     "has_item_from_group"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "r_i_g" 	for     "remove_item_group"[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m            "a_s"		for     "ammo_shells"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "a_n"		for     "ammo_nails"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "a_r"		for     "ammo_rockets"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "a_c"		for     "ammo_cells"[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m            "rv_s_h"	for     "remove_spawngroup"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "rs_s_h"	for     "restore_spawngroup"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "rv_gr"	    for     "remove_group_no"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "rs_gr"	    for     "restore_group_no"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "rv_g"	    for     "remove_goal_no"[m
[32m+[m[32m            "rs_g"	    for     "restore_goal_no"[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m	[32m- The "ex_skill_min" and "ex_skill_max" variables can now[m
[32m+[m[32m      use "-1" to mean 0. This is needed because specifying either[m
[32m+[m[32m      as 0 is the same as not specifying it at all.[m
[32m+[m[32m      E.g. An entity with:[m
[32m+[m[32m                "ex_skill_min" "-1"[m
[32m+[m[32m                "ex_skill_max" "-1"[m
[32m+[m[32m           Would only exist at skill 0.[m
[32m+[m[32m            An entity with:[m
[32m+[m[32m                "ex_skill_min" "-1"[m
[32m+[m[32m                "ex_skill_max" "2"[m
[32m+[m[32m           Would only exist at skill 0, 1, or 2.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m----------------------------------------------------------------------------[m
[32m+[m[32mIf you think of any more things goals could do when activated,[m
[32m+[m[32mplease don't hesitate to mail them to me.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAnd as a last word, I _really_ suggest that you use the Entity Editor.[m
[32m+[m[32mI use it myself. It's far too much of a pain mucking about getting all[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32mthe right variables set to the right things to bother with doing[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32mit all manually.[m
[32m+[m[32mOriginally, it looked like it would be feasible to do it yourself,[m
[32m+[m[32mbut they've just become far too complex now.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mHave fun![m
