[32m+[m[32mClassic Fortress v0.1 beta[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m=== New features ===[m
[32m+[m[32m* Grenade timers.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Grenade slot switching.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Weapon slots (1-4).[m
[32m+[m[32m* Next/previous weapon.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Last weapon.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Sensitivity scaling upon sniper zooming.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Sniper zoom key which zooms in regardless of sniper rifle status (setinfo zk 1).[m
[32m+[m[32m* Two sniper zoom modes (2x and 4x) which can be manually set with setinfo z2x and z4x.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Reverse sniper zoom order with setinfo zr 1.[m
[32m+[m[32m* New scout scanner menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* New demoman detpack menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* New sentry gun rotation menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Stop building/disguising upon pressing "last weapon" bind.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m=== Improved ===[m
[32m+[m[32m* Team player count in team selection menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Sniper smooth zooming is now a lot faster (disable smooth zooming with setinfo zi 1).[m
[32m+[m[32m* More responsive menus (rewritten menu code).[m
[32m+[m[32m* No more sbar blinking (rewritten sbar code).[m
[32m+[m[32m* Revised dispenser use menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Revised sentry gun menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Revised engineer build menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Revised spy disguise menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Overall improved menus.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Allow engineer build menu to be opened even while in the air.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Engineers can now only dismantle their own buildings.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m=== Changed ===[m
[32m+[m[32m* Remove decimals from sentry gun status.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Class configs are now executed from /fortress/classes/ subdirectory.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Allow team changing.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Any non-valid impulse now closes the active menu.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m== Removed ===[m
[32m+[m[32m* Removed bioweapon (merged into medikit).[m
[32m+[m[32m* Removed grapple hook.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Removed birthday mode.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Removed engineer mortar (not used anymore).[m
[32m+[m[32m* Removed bindings menu.[m
[32m+[m[32m* Removed class help.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m=== Fixed ===[m
[32m+[m[32m* Fixed the sentry gun menu to not close prematurely.[m
